tara ng: dropping a small JS backoff+jitter snippet here to include in PR:
```js
// exponential backoff with jitter
async function retryWithJitter(fn, attempts=5){
  for(let i=0;i<attempts;i++){
    try{
      return await fn();
    }catch(e){
      const shouldRetry = e.code === 429 || e.isTransient;
      if(!shouldRetry || i===attempts-1) throw e;
      const base = Math.pow(2,i) * 100;
      const jitter = Math.floor(Math.random()*100);
      await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, base + jitter));
    }
  }
}
```
